+      // content/child/runtime_features.cc calls that setter unconditionally
+      // (a switch->feature table plus a direct call). Setting it false deletes
+      // the symbol out from under upstream and the build fails to compile —
+      // see scripts/check-automation-readers.py, which guards the other half of
+      // this: if a future bump introduces a real reader of the feature, the bit
